a divergent Document can be processed, it must be taken care of by a user in order to be set as convergent, using one of the actions explained above.','Divergent','ERP5 Workflow Transition','Workflow Transition',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'diverge',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3283,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/transition_converge','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/transition_converge',3295,'transition_converge','This state is shown when the goods that are shipped equal the previsions','Convergent','ERP5 Workflow Transition','Workflow Transition',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'converge',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3284,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/transition_calculate','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/transition_calculate',3295,'transition_calculate','calculate if packing list is divergent or not','Calculate','ERP5 Workflow Transition','Workflow Transition',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'calculate',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3285,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_solving','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_solving',3295,'state_solving','Solving means that an action has been taken to correct the divergent state of a document in ERP5. During the calculations, the state will be displayed as Solving. Once the calculations are over, the state will become Solved.','Solving','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'solving',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3286,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_solved','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_solved',3295,'state_solved','The solved state is displayed whenever a divergent state has been corrected by a user of ERP5. A divergent state can strike a sales packing list for example, or an invoice, whenever the ordered and delivered quantities are different. Unless a user would take an action to solve this situation, the document could not be processed. When an action has been taken and the divergent stat has been corrected, the document will display the Solved state, and users will be able to process it again.','Solved','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'solved',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3287,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_draft','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_draft',3295,'state_draft','Default state of the document','Draft','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3288,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_diverged','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_diverged',3295,'state_diverged','State of packing list when the current is different from the prevision','Diverged','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'diverged',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:50'),(3289,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_calculating','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_calculating',3295,'state_calculating','This will be the state displayed whenever ERP5 is doing calculation. After the calculation is over, this state will be turned to another state, such as delivered for example, or solved.','Calculating','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'calculating',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:49'),(3290,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_building','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/state_building',3295,'state_building','Building is used when a packing list is confirmed, during the calculation process of ERP5. A building causality state indicates that the system is calculating whether the Packing list is convergent or divergent.','Building','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'building',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:49'),(3291,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/script_Workflow_solveDivergenceAutomatically','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/script_Workflow_solveDivergenceAutomatically',3295,'script_Workflow_solveDivergenceAutomatically','','Workflow_solveDivergenceAutomatically','ERP5 Workflow Script','Workflow Script',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Workflow_solveDivergenceAutomatically',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:49'),(3292,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/script_Delivery_solveDivergence','portal_workflow/delivery_causality_workflow/script_Delivery_solveDivergence',3295,'script_Delivery_solveDivergence','','Delivery_solveDivergence','ERP5 Workflow Script','Workflow Script',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Delivery_solveDivergence',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:38:36','2025-09-12 12:42:49'),(3293,6,'System Processes','System