,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:28','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6900,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_skins/erp5_pdm/SupplyLine_viewNonDiscountableAdditionalPrice','portal_skins/erp5_pdm/SupplyLine_viewNonDiscountableAdditionalPrice',0,'SupplyLine_viewNonDiscountableAdditionalPrice','','Non Discountable Additional Price','ERP5 Form','ERP5 Form',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:28','2025-09-12 12:43:25'),(6901,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Line','portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Line',497,'Returned Purchase Packing List Line','Returned Purchase Packing List Lines are part of returned purchase packing lists and bear the different product or service references that are returned by the company.','Returned Purchase Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6902,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Cell',497,'Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','A Returned Purchase Packing List Cell specifies a price and a quantity for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6903,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List','portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List',497,'Returned Purchase Packing List','Returned Purchase Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been delivered to a customer. It can track how delivered goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Returned Purchase Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6904,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Module','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Module',497,'Returned Purchase Order Module','Holds Returned Purchase Orders','Returned Purchase Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6905,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Line','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Line',497,'Returned Purchase Order Line','Purchase order lines are part of purchase orders and bear the different product or service references that have been purchased by the company.','Returned Purchase Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6906,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Cell','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Cell',497,'Returned Purchase Order Cell','A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Returned Purchase Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6907,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order',497,'Returned Purchase Order','','Returned Purchase Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6908,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition Module','portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition Module',497,'Purchase Trade Condition Module','Holds Purchase Trade Conditions','Purchase Trade Condition Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6909,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition','portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition',497,'Purchase Trade Condition','Purchase trade conditions are documents that gather all the details of a standard purchase order, such as the shipment or payment mode, the tax or discount behaviour. A purchase trade condition can be applied to a purchase order, and in this case, the information borne by the purchase trade condition will be imported to the purchase order. This is practical for the user, because it allows not to loose time typing the same information again and again.','Purchase Trade Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6910,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Module','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Module',497,'Purchase Packing List Module','Holds Purchase Packing Lists','Purchase Packing List Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6911,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Line','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Line',497,'Purchase Packing List Line','Purchase packing list lines are part of purchase packing lists, and bear the different references that have been ordered. For each product/service reference there will be a purchase packing list line.','Purchase Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6912,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Cell','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Cell',497,'Purchase Packing List Cell','Une ligne tarifaire.','Purchase Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6913,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List','portal_types/Purchase Packing List',497,'Purchase Packing List','Purchase Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been received from a supplier. It can track how received goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Purchase Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6914,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Module','portal_types/Purchase Order Module',497,'Purchase Order Module','Holds Purchase Orders','Purchase Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6915,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Line','portal_types/Purchase Order Line',497,'Purchase Order Line','Purchase order lines are part of purchase orders and bear the different product or service references that have been purchased by the company.','Purchase Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6916,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Cell','portal_types/Purchase Order Cell',497,'Purchase Order Cell','A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Purchase Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6917,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order','portal_types/Purchase Order',497,'Purchase Order','When a user of ERP5 wants to materialize a purchase that has been done by his company, he or she should use a purchase order. Purchase orders contain some general information about the buyer and the seller, and contain purchase order lines.','Purchase Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6918,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Payment Condition','portal_types/Payment Condition',497,'Payment Condition','Payment conditions can be either on a sale/purchase order or on a sale/purchase trade condition document. Payment condition describes the payment conditions that will be applied to an order, such as the payment mode, the term, etc..','Payment Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6919,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Order Root Simulation Rule','portal_types/Order Root Simulation Rule',497,'Order Root Simulation Rule','An ERP5 Rule...','Order Root Simulation Rule','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6920,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Order','portal_types/Order',497,'Order','This portal type is an abstract portal type, so that newContent(temp_object=True) calls can succeed; one should never have to use this portal type for persistent objects.','Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6921,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report Module','portal_types/Inventory Report Module',497,'Inventory Report Module','','Inventory Report Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6922,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report Line','portal_types/Inventory Report Line',497,'Inventory Report Line','An inventory line can be found in inventory documents, and bears the available stock of a certain product reference. There will be one inventory line for each product reference of the inventory.','Inventory Report Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6923,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report','portal_types/Inventory Report',497,'Inventory Report','','Inventory Report','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6924,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Module','portal_types/Inventory Module',497,'Inventory Module','An Order...','Inventory Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6925,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Line','portal_types/Inventory Line',497,'Inventory Line','An inventory line can be found in inventory documents, and bears the available stock of a certain product reference. There will be one inventory line for each product reference of the inventory.','Inventory Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6926,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Cell','portal_types/Inventory Cell',497,'Inventory Cell','      An InventoryCell allows to define specific inventory\n      for each variation of a resource in an inventory line.\n','Inventory Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6927,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory','portal_types/Inventory',497,'Inventory','The inventory module helps the user make a full inventory of the available products in the different warehouses of the company. There will be an inventory line for each product reference that is part of the inventory.','Inventory','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6928,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Trade Condition Module','portal_types/Internal Trade Condition Module',497,'Internal Trade Condition Module','','Internal Trade Condition Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6929,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Internal Trade Condition','portal_types/Internal Trade Condition',497,'Internal Trade Condition','Internal trade conditions are documents that gather all the details of a standard internal order, such as the shipment or payment mode, the tax or discount behaviour. A internal trade condition can be applied to a internal order, and in this case, the information borne by the internal trade condition will be imported to the internal order. This is practical for the user, because it allows not to loose time typing the same information again and again.','Internal Trade Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(6930,6,'System 