estinations), the dates and the quantity shares of a given amount generates by a Trade Model. Trade Model Path can be used to specify the tax office for a given a tax, the production facility for a given production phase or to split a payment in multiple payments to different banks.','Trade Model Path','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7479,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Trade Model Line Cell Consistency Constraint','portal_types/Trade Model Line Cell Consistency Constraint',497,'Trade Model Line Cell Consistency Constraint','A Trade Model Line Cell Consistency Constraint checks whether Trade Model Line should contain cells','Trade Model Line Cell Consistency Constraint','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7480,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Trade Model Line','portal_types/Trade Model Line',497,'Trade Model Line','Trade model line is...','Trade Model Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7481,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Trade Model Cell','portal_types/Trade Model Cell',497,'Trade Model Cell','Trade Model Cell\r\n','Trade Model Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7482,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Trade Condition Module','portal_types/Sale Trade Condition Module',497,'Sale Trade Condition Module','Folders allow to store a large number of documents (1,000,000 should not\r\nbe a problem).','Sale Trade Condition Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7483,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Trade Condition','portal_types/Sale Trade Condition',497,'Sale Trade Condition','Sale trade conditions are documents that gather all the details of a standard sale order, such as the shipment or payment mode, the tax or discount behaviour. A sale trade condition can be applied to a sale order, and in this case, the information borne by the sale trade condition will be imported to the sale order. This is practical for the user, because it allows not to loose time typing the same information again and again.','Sale Trade Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7484,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Packing List Module','portal_types/Sale Packing List Module',497,'Sale Packing List Module','An Order...','Sale Packing List Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7485,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Packing List Line','portal_types/Sale Packing List Line',497,'Sale Packing List Line','Sale packing list lines are part of sale packing lists, and bear the different references that have been sold. For each product/service reference there will be a sale packing list line.','Sale Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7486,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Packing List Cell','portal_types/Sale Packing List Cell',497,'Sale Packing List Cell','Une ligne tarifaire.','Sale Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7487,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Packing List','portal_types/Sale Packing List',497,'Sale Packing List','Sale Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been delivered to a customer. It can track how delivered goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Sale Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7488,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Order Module','portal_types/Sale Order Module',497,'Sale Order Module','An Order...','Sale Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7489,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Order Line','portal_types/Sale Order Line',497,'Sale Order Line','Sale order lines are part of sale orders and bear the different product or service references that have been sold by the company.','Sale Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7490,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Order Cell','portal_types/Sale Order Cell',497,'Sale Order Cell','A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Sale Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7491,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Sale Order','portal_types/Sale Order',497,'Sale Order','When a user of ERP5 wants to materialize a sale that has been done by his company, he or she should use a sale order. Sale orders contain some general information about the buyer and the seller, and contain sale order lines.','Sale Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7492,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Module','portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Module',497,'Returned Sale Packing List Module','Contains Returned Sale Packing List','Returned Sale Packing List Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7493,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Line','portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Line',497,'Returned Sale Packing List Line','Returned Sale Packing List Lines are part of returend sale packing lists and bear the different product or service references that are returned by the customer.','Returned Sale Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7494,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Cell','portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List Cell',497,'Returned Sale Packing List Cell','A Returned Sale Packing List Cell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Returned Sale Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7495,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List','portal_types/Returned Sale Packing List',497,'Returned Sale Packing List','Returned Sale Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been delivered to a customer. It can track how delivered goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Returned Sale Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:39:56','2025-09-12 12:43:26'),(7496,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Sale Order Module','portal_types/Returned Sale Order Module',497,'Returned Sale Order Module','An Order...','Returned Sale Order Modul