ng drafted by the user. Outgoing events must be validated through the Submit action. Incoming events must be validated through the Assign action.','Draft','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:18','2025-09-12 12:43:00'),(9154,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_delivered','portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_delivered',9166,'state_delivered','Events in this state are outgoing events which were sent to recipients and which recipients acknowledged their receival.','Delivered','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'delivered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:18','2025-09-12 12:43:00'),(9155,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_deleted','portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_deleted',9166,'state_deleted','Documents in this state were deleted by the user as a result of clicking on the trash button or calling the delete action','Deleted','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'deleted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:18','2025-09-12 12:43:00'),(9156,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_cancelled','portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_cancelled',9166,'state_cancelled','Events in this state are incoming or outgoing events which could not be further processed. The reason why processing was stopped should be defined in the workflow history as a text comment.','Cancelled','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'cancelled',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:18','2025-09-12 12:43:00'),(9157,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/event_workflow/state_assigned','