P5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'planned',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:03'),(10482,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_ordered','portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_ordered',10490,'state_ordered','Ordered tasks are tasks which the Assignor ordered but which may still be modified (ex. date) before being confirmed.','Ordered','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'ordered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:03'),(10483,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_draft','portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_draft',10490,'state_draft','All tasks start in draft state. This is the state in which the user should define all task properties before submitting them through a workflow action or deleting them.','Draft','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:03'),(10484,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_deleted','portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_deleted',10490,'state_deleted','Deleted tasks are draft tasks which were deleted by their owner or Assignor.','Deleted','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'deleted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:40:36','2025-09-12 12:43:03'),(10485,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_confirmed','portal_workflow/task_workflow/state_confirmed',10490,'state_confirmed','Confirmed tasks are tasks which the Assignor has confirmed and which will never be cancelled or modified.','Confirmed','ERP5 Workflow State','Workflow State',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL