ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:33'),(13378,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Production Packing List','portal_types/Production Packing List',497,'Production Packing List','A Production Packing List provides a trace of finished goods and services delivered by a workshop or a production facility. It can track how received goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single Production Order may result in multiple Production Packing Lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone production, accept the changes to initial production plan, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Production Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13379,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Production Order Module','portal_types/Production Order Module',497,'Production Order Module','Holds Production Orders','Production Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13380,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Production Order Line','portal_types/Production Order Line',497,'Production Order Line','Defines price, dates and quantity of resource to be produced, allows to choose transformation, which will be used','Production Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13381,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Production Order Cell','portal_types/Production Order Cell',497,'Production Order Cell','A OrderCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a order line.','Production Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13382,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Production Order','portal_types/Production Order',497,'Production Order','A Production Order allows for entering production order information, actors involved in an order, payment conditions, ordered products or services, quantity, price, etc. It also allows to choose supply chain defining the production process and. It follows a standard production order workflow which represents the maturity of an order from prospect to confirmation. Once an order is confirmed, it can not be modified.','Production Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13383,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Order Module','portal_types/Manufacturing Order Module',497,'Manufacturing Order Module','','Manufacturing Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13384,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Order Line','portal_types/Manufacturing Order Line',497,'Manufacturing Order Line','Defines price, dates and quantity of resource to be produced, allows to choose transformation, which will be used','Manufacturing Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13385,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Order Cell','portal_types/Manufacturing Order Cell',497,'Manufacturing Order Cell','A OrderCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a order line.','Manufacturing Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13386,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Order','portal_types/Manufacturing Order',497,'Manufacturing Order','A Manufacturing Order allows for entering manufacturing order information, actors involved in an order, payment conditions, ordered products or services, quantity, price, etc. It also allows to choose supply chain defining the production process and. It follows a standard production order workflow which represents the maturity of an order from prospect to confirmation. Once an order is confirmed, it can not be modified.','Manufacturing Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13387,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Execution Module','portal_types/Manufacturing Execution Module',497,'Manufacturing Execution Module','Holds Manufacturing Executions','Manufacturing Execution Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-12 12:41:26','2025-09-12 12:43:31'),(13388,6,'System Processes','System Processes','/erp5/portal_types/Manufacturing Execution Line','portal_types/Manufacturing Execution Line',4