age This base category defines the insurance coverage of a Person or Organisation. A Person can be covered by the insurance of another Person and/or and Insurance contract directly.'),(1962,'Group Group define the corporate group and the business unit structure. Group is acquired through careers and subordination.'),(1963,'Grade Grade is like a job classification on which the employee pay is determined. It\'s also similar to military grade.'),(1964,'Gender'),(1965,'Function Function correspond to the task you do day by day.'),(1966,'Follow Up'),(1967,'End Of End of what to wait...'),(1968,'Economical Class'),(1969,'Divergence Scope'),(1970,'Destination Region A virtual Category which allows to access the region of destination value of a Movement as if it were a category.'),(1971,'Destination Referral'),(1972,'Destination Carrier'),(1973,'Delivery Solver'),(1974,'Delivery Builder'),(1975,'Currency Exchange Type'),(1976,'Creator'),(1977,'Contributor'),(1978,'Conflicting Solver'),(1979,'Collect Order Group This category is used for Movement Groups in Builders.'),(1980,'Bank Account Type This category represents bank account type such as saving account, checking account, etc.'),(1981,'Agent Privilege'),(1982,'Agent'),(1983,'Variation Property Movement Group   The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n\n  This movement group is used to group movements that have the same\n  variation property dict.'),(1984,'Variant Movement Group   The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.'),(1985,'Title Movement Group   The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.'),(1986,'Telephone A Telephone object can contain a telephone number.'),(1987,'Split Movement Group   The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how