n_input.html 001 Relation Input Interface\n\nA gadget used to allow user searching/selecting a document\n\nrender\n    Display a single relation field\n\n    option_dict\n        HAL parameters'),(14368,'Interface Panel interface_panel.html 001 Panel Interface\n\nrender\n    Render a global panel\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ editable: global application editable state\n          ☆ view: current view URL parameter\n          ☆ erp5_document: HAL represention of the currently displayed document\n\ntoggle\n    Toogle the visibility of the panel\n\nclose\n    Hide the panel'),(14369,'Interface Page interface_page.html 001 Page Interface\n\nGadget loaded by the launcher\n\nrender\n    Render the page\n\n    option_dict\n        A dictionnary filed with URL parameters\n\ntriggerSubmit\n    Submit the page main action'),(14370,'Interface Notification interface_notification.html 001 Notification Interface\n\nGadget used to manage the UI notification\n\nnotify\n    display a notification\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ message: notification text\n          ☆ status: success/error\n\nclose\n    Hide the notification'),(14371,'Interface Maximize Button interface_maximize_button.html 001 Maximize Button Interface\n\nrender\n    Display the ERP5 field'),(14372,'Interface Listbox interface_listbox.html 001 Listbox Interface\n\ngetListboxInfo\n    Return a dictionnary with internal listbox state (search_column_list,\n    domain_list, domain_dict, begin_from)'),(14373,'Interface Launcher interface_launcher.html 001 Launcher Interface\n\nGadget used to launch the application\n\ndeclareAndExecuteNotificationGadget\n    XXX\n\ndeclareAndExecuteTranslationGadget\n    XXX\n\ndeclareAndExecuteHeaderGadget\n    XXX\n\ndeclareAndExecutePanelGadget\n    XXX\n\ndeclareAndExecuteEditorPanelGadget\n    XXX\n\nrender\n    XXX'),(14374,'Interface Label Field interface_label_field.html 001 Label Field Interface\n\nRender an ERP5 Field\'s label\n\nrender\n    Display the label\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ field_json: field_json parameter used to render the field\n          ☆ label: add a label element to the DOM\n          ☆ field_type: type of the ERP5 Field (StringField, IntegerField, ...)\n          ☆ error_text: Error message linked to the field\n\ngetListboxInfo\n    Call getListboxInfo on the ERP5 field gadget'),(14375,'Interface jIO interface_jio.html 001 jIO Interface\n\nGadget used to call jIO\n\ncreateJio\n    createJio\n\nallDocs\n    allDocs\n\nallAttachments\n    allAttachments\n\nget\n    get\n\nput\n    put\n\npost\n    post\n\nremove\n    remove\n\ngetAttachment\n    getAttachment\n\nputAttachment\n    putAttachment\n\nremoveAttachment\n    removeAttachment\n\nrepair\n    repair'),(14376,'Interface HTML5 Input interface_html5_input.html 001 HTML5 Input Interface\n\nGenerate a HTML5 input tag\n\nrender\n    Display the input tag\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ value: value attribute\n          ☆ checked: checked attribute\n          ☆ editable: readonly attribute\n          ☆ required: required attribute\n          ☆ id: id attribute\n          ☆ name: name attribute\n          ☆ type: type attribute\n          ☆ title: title attribute\n          ☆ focus: autofocus attribute\n          ☆ step: step attribute\n          ☆ hidden: hidden attribute\n          ☆ multiple: multiple attribute\n          ☆ accept: accept attribute\n          ☆ capture: capture attribute\n          ☆ append: text to append after the field\n          ☆ prepend: text to prepend infront the field\n          ☆ trim: trim the value returned by getContent'),(14377,'Interface Header interface_header.html 001 Header Interface\n\nGadget used to manage the application header\n\nnotifyLoading\n    Start the loading spinner\n\nnotifyLoaded\n    Stop the loading spinner\n\nnotifyChange\n    Show the \'not saved content\' warning\n\nnotifySubmitting\n    Start the submit spinner\n\nnotifySubmitted\n    Remove the \'not saved content\' warning\n\nnotifyError\n    Activate all warning!\n\nsetButtonTitle\n    Activate a main button on the panel (to reduce maximize state for example)\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ icon: button icon\n          ☆ action: button name. Used to know which kind of action to do when\n            clicking it\n\nrender\n    Render the header\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ page_title: main title\n          ☆ page_icon: surcharge the default icon if needed\n          ☆ XXX_url: activate a link with this URL on the header if present\n            (front_url, selection_url, ...)\n          ☆ panel_action: activate the panel menu button\n          ☆ extra_class: a dictionnary to extend the button/link rendering'),(14378,'Interface ERP5 Page Template interface_erp5_page_template.html 001 ERP5 Page Template Interface\n\nA gadget which render a specific ERP5 page template (form_list, form_view,...)\n\nrender\n    Display the page template with its expected value\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ erp5_document: HAL representation of the ERP5 Document context\n          ☆ form_definition: HAL representation of the ERP5 Form\n          ☆ erp5_form: HAL representation of the rendered ERP5 Form in the\n            document context\n          ☆ jio_key: jio key of the ERP5 document\n          ☆ view: URL of the rendered form\n          ☆ editable: editable state of the form. Impact all fields\n          ☆ title: title of the rendered form\n\ntriggerSubmit\n    Submit the main page template action (Base_edit, Base_callDialogMethod,\n    ...) if any'),(14379,'Interface ERP5 Form Content Provider interface_erp5_form_content_provider.html 001 ERP5 Form Content Provider Interface\n\nReturn the editable values of a form\n\ngetContent\n    Get the user input value. Return a field_key/value dictionnary\n\ncheckValidity\n    Check if the form input is valid'),(14380,'Interface ERP5 Form interface_erp5_form.html 001 ERP5 Form Interface\n\nERP5 form\n\nrender\n    Render an ERP5 Form\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ erp5_document: HAL representation of the ERP5 Document context\n          ☆ form_definition: HAL representation of the ERP5 Form\n          ☆ jio_key: jio key of the ERP5 document\n          ☆ view: URL of the rendered form\n          ☆ editable: editable state of the form. Impact all fields\n          ☆ title: title of the rendered form\n\ngetListboxInfo\n    Call getListboxInfo on the main listbox. Return {} by default.'),(14381,'Interface ERP5 Field interface_erp5_field.html 001 ERP5 Field Interface\n\nField usable in a ERP5 form\n\nrender\n    Display the ERP5 field\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ field_json: JSON dict returned by HAL style'),(14382,'Interface Editor Panel interface_editor_panel.html 001 Editor Panel Interface\n\nA panel used to display contextual information\n\nrender\n    Render a contextual subpanel (sort, configure, ...)\n\n    url\n        URL of the subpanel gadget\n    option_dict\n        Parameter needed to render the subpanel gadget\n\ntoggle\n    Toogle the visibility of the editor panel\n\nclose\n    Hide the editor panel'),(14383,'Interface Editor interface_editor.html 001 Editor Interface\n\nA rich editor gadget which handle many kind of content type\n\nrender\n    Render a rich editor (ckeditor, codemirror, svgeditor, ...)\n\n    option_dict\n          ☆ value: text content to view/edit\n          ☆ editor: specific editor value (fck_editor, pdf, text_area,\n            svg_editor, onlyoffice, codemirror)\n          ☆ content_type: content type of the document\n          ☆ maximize: show a maximize button to set the editor in full screen\n          ☆ portal_type: portal type of the document\n          ☆ editable: is the content modifiable\n          ☆ key: the key used to return the new value with getContent'),(14384,'WebSocket Gadget JS gadget_websocket.js 001 /*jslint indent: 2*/ /*global rJS, window, WebSocket, RSVP*/ (function (rJS,\nwindow, WebSocket, RSVP) { \"use strict\"; function enqueueDefer(gadget,\ncallback) { var deferred = gadget.props.curren